# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
"""Backend IL truc tiep (thu 4) cho typed_dsl_parser.py - tai dung dung
Signature/TypeAnn/body_lines (KHONG sua file goc), sinh THANG CIL text
(khong qua tang C#/csc.exe nua - bo qua hoan toan), bien dich bang
ilasm.exe CO SAN trong .NET Framework.

Kien truc song song voi csharp_codegen.py (cung 1 body_lines dung chung
cho ca 2 backend), nhung khac hoan toan ve co che sinh code vi CIL la
STACK MACHINE (khong co bieu thuc infix nhu C#) - phai co 1 bo dich bieu
thuc nho (tokenizer + recursive-descent + codegen) rieng cho tap con cu
phap bieu thuc dung trong 2 building block matmul/dot-product (so, ten
bien, .shape[N], index 1-2 chieu, + - *).

DIEM KHAC BIET QUAN TRONG voi csharp_codegen.py: shape la HANG SO BIET
LUC CODEGEN (tu Signature.params[i].type_ann.shape), nen `.shape[N]`
duoc thay THANG bang so nguyen (khong can goi runtime GetLength() nhu
ban C# phai lam vi C# dich tu Python source dung bien shape runtime).
Guard-check (kiem tra kich thuoc THAT luc goi ham) van phai dung runtime
GetLength() - do la viec RIENG, khac voi viec tinh kich thuoc mang tam
thoi trong than ham.

Mang 2 chieu (rank 2, vd float32[64,64]) trong CIL KHONG dung
newarr/ldelem/stelem (chi danh cho mang 1 chieu/"vector") ma dung cac
gia-phuong-thuc (pseudo-method) cua chinh kieu mang do:
  tao:  newobj instance void float32[0...,0...]::.ctor(int32, int32)
  doc:  callvirt instance float32 float32[0...,0...]::Get(int32, int32)
  ghi:  callvirt instance void float32[0...,0...]::Set(int32, int32, float32)
Day la cu phap CHUAN cua ECMA-335 (chinh csc.exe cung sinh y het pattern
nay cho float[,] cua C#) - KHONG phai suy doan, la quy uoc bat buoc cua
CLR cho mang rank>1.
"""
